<TD WIDTH="1%" VALIGN="top">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">The amendment to the COI to effect a reverse stock split of the Common Stock by a ratio of <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap">1-3,</FONT> and a corresponding reduction in the total number of shares of Common Stock that the Company is authorized to issue under the COI. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
